Walkthrough\" /></p>\n<p><em>Home → 6 Live Replay sources → OBS WebSocket setup → Twitch import → Finished clip with captions &amp; one-click publish.</em></p><hr />\n<h2 id=\"whats-new-in-v16\">What's New in v1.6</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">Feature</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Details</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>6 Live Replay Sources</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Dedicated <strong>Live Replay</strong> tab supporting <strong>OBS Studio, Twitch, YouTube, Kick, Discord, and local recordings</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>OBS Auto-Capture</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Connect OBS WebSocket (<code>4455</code>), trim losslessly (<code>-c copy</code>), and auto-queue clips right after you end stream.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Game Highlights</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Generalized highlight detection supporting <strong>8s+</strong> standalone plays with tighter vision/OCR budgets.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>One-Click Repurpose</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Unified playable clip cards — switch target platforms in one click without losing previous exports.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>13 Languages</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Full desktop UI, tray menus, and docs in 13 languages (<code>+ zh-TW, de, id, tr, vi</code>) plus Arabic RTL captions.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<details>\n<summary>📸 Inside the App (5 screenshots)</summary><table>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/v1.6/en-01-home.jpg\" alt=\"Home screen with Link, File, and Live Replay tabs\" /><br />\n<em>Home screen — Link, File, and Live Replay</em>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/v1.6/en-02-replays-obs.jpg\" alt=\"Live Replay 6-source picker\" /><br />\n<em>Live Replay — 6 replay sources</em>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/v1.6/en-03-replays-obs-settings.jpg\" alt=\"Inline OBS Studio WebSocket connection settings\" /><br />\n<em>Inline OBS Studio WebSocket settings</em>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/v1.6/en-04-replays-twitch.jpg\" alt=\"Twitch replay import\" /><br />\n<em>Twitch import &amp; local recording picker</em>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/v1.6/en-05-result-card.jpg\" width=\"75%\" alt=\"Finished clip with Twitch source attribution\" /><br />\n<em>Finished clip — source attribution, 9:16 crop, captions, and one-click Download / Publish / Redo</em>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table></details><hr />\n<h2 id=\"examples\">Examples</h2>\n<p>Click any thumbnail or <strong>▶ Play</strong> to watch full clips rendered by AutoClip. Language labels indicate burned-in subtitle language.</p>\n<h3 id=\"vertical--interview--podcast\">Vertical · Interview &amp; Podcast</h3>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/gates-ezra/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/demos/gates-ezra-01.jpg\" width=\"180\" alt=\"Bill Gates\" /></a><br />\n<strong>Bill Gates</strong><br />\nInterview · Douyin · ZH<br />\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/gates-ezra/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\">▶ Play 1:01</a> · <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A_156w0aYtU\">Source</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/ai-labs-debate/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/demos/ai-labs-debate-01.jpg\" width=\"180\" alt=\"AI Experts Debate\" /></a><br />