om/watch?v=Hrbq66XqtCo\">Source</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/karpathy-dwarkesh/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/demos/karpathy-dwarkesh-01.jpg\" width=\"180\" alt=\"Andrej Karpathy\" /></a><br />\n<strong>Andrej Karpathy</strong><br />\nInterview · Douyin · ZH<br />\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/karpathy-dwarkesh/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\">▶ Play 0:43</a> · <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lXUZvyajciY\">Source</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/apple-a20/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/demos/apple-a20-01.jpg\" width=\"180\" alt=\"A20 Pro\" /></a><br />\n<strong>A20 Pro</strong><br />\nInterview · Xiaohongshu · ZH<br />\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/apple-a20/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\">▶ Play 2:00</a> · <a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1e4Y96FEaJ/\">Source</a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/stallone-nyt/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/demos/stallone-nyt-01.jpg\" width=\"180\" alt=\"Sylvester Stallone\" /></a><br />\n<strong>Sylvester Stallone</strong><br />\nInterview · Douyin · ZH<br />\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/stallone-nyt/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\">▶ Play 1:39</a> · <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ccs-B_nTfZs\">Source</a>\n</td>\n<td align=\"center\">\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/mrbeast-colin-samir/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/images/demos/mrbeast-colin-samir-01.jpg\" width=\"180\" alt=\"MrBeast\" /></a><br />\n<strong>MrBeast</strong><br />\nPodcast · TikTok · EN<br />\n<a href=\"https://pub-3fb92949b9c2480b89feec5ec03f3540.r2.dev/cases/mrbeast-colin-samir/01.mp4?v=2026-10-01g\">▶ Play 1:42</a> · <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9IQ_ldV9z_A\">Source</a>\n</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</table></details><p>Browse 16+ clips, covers, and post copy in the <strong><a href=\"https://zhouxiaoka.github.io/autoclip_intro/cases/?lang=en\">Showcase →</a></strong>, or <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/discussions/new?category=show-and-tell\">share your own clips</a>. Source copyrights remain with their original creators.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><a href></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"quick-start\">Quick Start</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">Use case</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Recommended setup</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Requirements</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Desktop app (easiest)</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Download <code>.dmg</code> / <code>-setup.exe</code> from <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/releases/latest\">Releases</a></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Apple Silicon macOS or Windows 10/11 x64 (Python &amp; FFmpeg bundled)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>AI agents / CLI / MCP</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>uvx autoclip-mcp</code> or <code>npx skills add zhouxiaoka/autoclip</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Python 3.10+ (3.11 recommended) &amp; FFmpeg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Self-hosted / Linux / Intel Mac</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>docker compose up -d --build</code></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Docker &amp; Compose v2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"1-desktop-app\">1. Desktop App</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the latest installer from <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/releases/latest\">GitHub Releases</a></strong> (<code>aarch64.dmg</code> for Apple Silicon macOS, <code>x64-setup.exe</code> for Windows). Portable Python and FFmpeg are bundled.</li>\n<li>Open <strong>Settings</strong>, pick a cloud provider (or start Ollama / LM Studio), test the connection, and save — or click <strong>Try the built-in example</strong> with no API key.</li>\n<li>Paste a video link, drop a file, or switch to <strong>Live Replay</strong> to connect OBS or import a stream recording. Pick your platforms and click <strong>Generate</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Installers are built publicly on GitHub Actions (<code>Desktop Build</code>) with <code>build-provenance.json</code> SHA-256 verification. First launch on an unsigned build: on <strong>macOS</strong> run <code>xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine \"/Applications/AutoClip Desktop.app\"</code> (or <em>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Open Anyway</em>); on <strong>Windows</strong> click <strong>More info → Run anyway</strong> on SmartScreen. See <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/CODE_SIGNING.md\">Code Signing &amp; Verification Policy</a></strong> (notarization tracked in <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/issues/119\">#119</a>).</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"2-cli--mcp-claude-code-cursor-codex-opencode--scripts\">2. CLI &amp; MCP (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenCode &amp; scripts)</h3>\n<p>Let AI coding agents clip videos directly from your terminal (<code>claude mcp add autoclip -- uvx autoclip-mcp</code>). Full MCP setup guides: <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MCP.en.md\">English</a></strong> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/CLI_AND_MCP.md\">简体中文</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MCP.ja.md\">日本語</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MCP.ko.md\">한국어</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MCP.es.md\">Español</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MCP.de.md\">Deutsch</a>.</p>\n<pre><code>uvx autoclip-mcp\nnpx skills add zhouxiaoka/autoclip\n\nautoclip --version\nautoclip produce talk.mp4 --srt talk.srt --platform tiktok --portrait-style podcast --json\nautoclip outputs PROJECT_ID --export-kits\n</code></pre>\n<details>\n<summary>Offline wheel, source install &amp; MCPB packaging</summary><pre><code># Install from a downloaded CLI/MCP release ZIP wheel\npython3 -m venv .venv &amp;&amp; source .venv/bin/activate\npython -m pip install -r requirements.txt\npython -m pip install --force-reinstall --no-deps autoclip_mcp-*-py3-none-any.whl\n\n# Or install from source\npython -m pip install --no-deps .\n</code></pre>\n<p>To build a local MCPB bundle without publishing, run <code>python scripts/pack_mcpb.py</code> (never run <code>smithery mcp publish</code> automatically).</p>\n</details><h3 id=\"3-docker--web\">3. Docker / Web</h3>\n<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip.git\ncd autoclip\ncp env.example .env\nmkdir -p data logs uploads\ndocker compose up -d --build\n</code></pre>\n<p>Open the web UI at <code>http://localhost:3000</code> (API docs at <code>http://localhost:8000/docs</code>). See <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/DOCKER.en.md\">Docker Guide</a> for bind-mount permissions and custom origins.</p>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"benchmarks\">Benchmarks</h2>\n<p>Measured on an Apple Silicon Mac (LLM cost estimated with <code>qwen-plus</code>; excludes cloud ASR and AI image generation; check your provider bill for exact usage):</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">Input</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Source</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Time &amp; Output</th>\n<th align=\"right\">Est. LLM Cost</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>With existing subtitles</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Jensen Huang · 1h 43m (EN → Xiaohongshu)</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><strong>7.5 min / 10 clips</strong></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><strong>¥0.09</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>No subtitles (local Whisper)</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">TIM × Luo Yonghao · 2h 52m (ZH → Douyin)</td>\n<td align=\"right\">29.5 min / 10 clips</td>\n<td align=\"right\">¥0.20</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"sponsor\">Sponsor ❤️</h2>\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\">\n      <a href=\"https://go.apimart.ai/tw-autoclip\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/main/docs/sponsors/apimart.png\" alt=\"APIMart\" width=\"88\" /></a><br />\n      <a href=\"https://go.apimart.ai/tw-autoclip\"><strong>APIMart</strong></a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      Thanks to <strong>APIMart</strong> for sponsoring AutoClip! <strong>APIMart</strong> is a low-cost API platform for AI image &amp; video generation — GPT-Image-2 from <strong>$0.006/image</strong> (<strong>160+</strong> images per dollar). One async API covers both image and video: submit a task, get an ID, fetch results via polling or callback. Batch tens of thousands of images without timeouts and switch models without changing code. Pay-as-you-go with no monthly fee — <a href=\"https://go.apimart.ai/tw-autoclip\">sign up here</a>.\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table><h2 id=\"cloud-transcription-alibaba-cloud\">Cloud Transcription (Alibaba Cloud)</h2>\n<p><em>Affiliate link (separate from the sponsor above):</em> sign up on Alibaba Cloud, create an API key in the Bailian console, and enable Bailian cloud ASR under <strong>Settings → Default models → Speech to subtitles</strong>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aliyun.com/benefit?userCode=qmyj6jch\">Alibaba Cloud signup</a> (affiliate link)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bailian.console.aliyun.com/\">Bailian console</a> — create your API key</li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"faq\">FAQ</h2>\n<details>\n<summary>Is AutoClip free? Do I need an API key?</summary><p>Yes — AutoClip is free and MIT-licensed. Cloud analysis, transcription, and AI covers use your own API keys at provider rates (local cover layout is free by default). Ollama and LM Studio require no cloud key. Direct publishing uses your own Bilibili or <a href=\"https://www.upload-post.com\">Upload-Post</a> account.</p>\n</details><details>\n<summary>Does my video get uploaded to the cloud?</summary><p>Cutting and rendering run locally. Cloud analysis only sends transcript text; vision models only receive sampled frames; cloud ASR uploads audio. Running local LLMs + Whisper / SenseVoice keeps everything offline. Analytics and crash reports can be turned off in Settings. See <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/PRIVACY.en.md\">Privacy</a>.</p>\n</details><details>\n<summary>What kind of videos work best?</summary><p>Podcasts, interviews, talks, courses, and gaming live stream replays (OBS / Twitch / YouTube / Kick / Discord). Sources with existing subtitles are fastest; otherwise use local Whisper / SenseVoice or cloud ASR. For gameplay or low-dialogue streams, enable a vision-capable model.</p>\n</details><details>\n<summary>Why weren't any clips generated?</summary><p>Check the failed stage: subtitles/transcription, model connection, FFmpeg, disk space, or platform length limits (YouTube long-form requires ≥180s; use Shorts, TikTok, or Bilibili for shorter clips). If it still fails, open an issue with <code>autoclip --version</code>, OS, model, and redacted logs, or check <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/issues/96\">Known Issues (#96)</a>.</p>\n</details><p><a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/FAQ.en.md\">Troubleshooting</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/issues/96\">Known Issues</a></p>\n<hr />\n<p><a href></a></p>\n<h2 id=\"documentation\">Documentation</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">Topic</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Guide</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Install &amp; first clips</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/USER_INSTALLATION_GUIDE.en.md\">Installation Guide</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Self-hosting &amp; agents</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/DOCKER.en.md\">Docker</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MCP.en.md\">MCP &amp; AI Agents</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/CLI_AND_MCP.md\">ZH</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MCP.ja.md\">JA</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MCP.ko.md\">KO</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MCP.es.md\">ES</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MCP.de.md\">DE</a>) · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/skills/autoclip/SKILL.md\">Agent Skill</a> (ZH) · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/OPENCODE.en.md\">OpenCode</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Models &amp; troubleshooting</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/MULTI_LLM_PROVIDER_GUIDE.md\">Multi-LLM Setup</a> (ZH) · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/FAQ.en.md\">FAQ</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Releases &amp; privacy</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">Changelog</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/CODE_SIGNING.md\">Code Signing</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/ROADMAP.md\">Roadmap</a> (ZH) · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/COMMUNITY_BOARD.md\">Community Board</a> (ZH) · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/PRIVACY.en.md\">Privacy</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Research</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/research/2026-10-what-drives-views/article-en.md\">Pick the Moment, Not the Effect</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/research/2026-10-what-drives-views/article-zh.md\">中文</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">Contributing &amp; i18n</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\">Contributing</a> (ZH) · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/TRANSLATING.md\">Translating AutoClip</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/docs/i18n.md\">Translation Guide</a> (ZH)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"contribute\">Contribute</h2>\n<p>PRs, bug reports, sample clips, and translations are welcome. If AutoClip saves you time, a ⭐ star helps!</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Community:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/discussions\">GitHub Discussions</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/discussions/128\">First-Clip Q&amp;A</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/discussions/129\">Feature Ideas</a></li>\n<li><strong>Bug reports:</strong> use the <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/issues/new/choose\">issue template</a> with OS, version, model, repro steps, and redacted logs</li>\n<li><strong>Partnerships:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:christine_zhouye@163.com\">christine_zhouye@163.com</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>AutoClip is maintained solo — please expect async replies (no live or 1-on-1 setup support).</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://api.star-history.com/svg?repos=zhouxiaoka/autoclip&amp;type=Date\" alt=\"Star History\" /></p>\n<p>Built with FastAPI, React, Tauri, FFmpeg, yt-dlp, Whisper, and FunASR. <a href=\"https://github.com/zhouxiaoka/autoclip/blob/main/LICENSE\">MIT License</a>.</p>\n","toc":[{"id":"autoclip","text":"AutoClip","level":2},{"id":"turn-any-video-link-or-live-stream-into-ready-to-post-clips","text":"Turn any video, link, or live stream into ready-to-post clips.","level":3},{"id":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"id":"whats-new-in-v16","text":"What's New in v1.6","level":2},{"id":"examples","text":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"vertical--interview--podcast","text":"Vertical · Interview & Podcast","level":3},{"id":"landscape--original-aspect-ratio","text":"Landscape · Original Aspect Ratio","level":3},{"id":"quick-start","text":"Quick Start","level":2},{"id":"1-desktop-app","text":"1. Desktop App","level":3},{"id":"2-cli--mcp-claude-code-cursor-codex-opencode--scripts","text":"2. CLI & MCP (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, OpenCode & scripts)","level":3},{"id":"3-docker--web","text":"3. Docker / Web","level":3},{"id":"benchmarks","text":"Benchmarks","level":2},{"id":"sponsor","text":"Sponsor ❤️","level":2},{"id":"cloud-transcription-alibaba-cloud","text":"Cloud Transcription (Alibaba Cloud)","level":2},{"id":"faq","text":"FAQ","level":2},{"id":"documentation","text":"Documentation","level":2},{"id":"contribute","text":"Contribute","level":2}]},"skills":[{"name":"autoclip","description":"- 用 AutoClip 把一条 YouTube / B 站链接，或本地长视频（讲座、访谈、播客、课程），做成各平台成片、封面、发布文案和 ZIP 发布包。 当用户要「出片」「做封面」「写发布文案」「打包发布」「从这个链接做短视频」时使用。 只要原始高光切片、合集，或把旧切片发到 Upload-Post 时不要用这份说明，改读 references/legacy.md。","path":"skills/autoclip"},{"name":"product-board","description":"- 维护 AutoClip 的公开社区看板。当用户要看社区反馈、整理功能呼声、把一条讨论放进路线图、 或问 GitHub Discussions、Projects、Quackback、Featurebase 该怎么接时使用。 想法留在 Discussions，只有人确认后才开 Issue。","path":"skills/product-board"},{"name":"template-cloner","description":"- 将一条爆款切片参考视频（.mp4/.mov）、几张小红书/抖音截图，或风格需求描述， 逆向拆解并克隆成符合 AutoClip TemplateSpec v2 契约的动态成片模板包， 完成安全与契约校验、一键热安装到本机 AutoClip，或打包发布到 GitHub Releases catalog.json。 当用户说「克隆这个视频样式」「扒一下这条切片模板」「做一个类似小红书/访谈风格的成片模板」时使用。","path":"skills/template-cloner"}],"skillCount":3,"marketplace":false,"plugin":false,"docker":true,"npm":null,"pypi":"autoclip-mcp","install":{"run":{"command":"uvx","args":["autoclip-mcp"]},"skillsAdd":"npx skills add zhouxiaoka/autoclip"},"releases":[{"tag":"v1.6.2","name":"AutoClip Desktop v1.6.2","date":"2026-11-26T14:07:52Z","url":"h